  My gut tells me a new approach to generating circle centers is crucial. I''ve been considering optimization techniques – perhaps a gradient-based or simulated annealing approach to simultaneously optimize the center positions and radii. However, I need to work within the confines of the `construct_packing` function, and that means the optimization has to happen *inside* that.


