  Specifically, I''ll be using `N_PROSPECT = 1024` and `DELTA0_VAL = 0.015`.  The critical change will be to reduce `PROSPECT_ITER` to 10 and crank up `REFINE_ITER` to 30.  I''m curious to see how this affects performance compared to the baseline.


  Right, time to get the code ready. I''ll need to submit the modified script with these parameters clearly set.  It''s crucial that I include the required supporting functions within the `content` field.  I''ll double-check to make sure all the essentials are there: `solve_radii_lp`, `get_seed`, `mm_lp_optimize`, `worker_function`, and the all-important `refine_worker`.  Gotta be meticulous; a small oversight could invalidate the results.  Time to get to it!

  '
