  Now, I''m moving on to **Experiment D**. This experiment will investigate a more balanced distribution of iterations, setting `PROSPECT_ITER = 12` and `REFINE_ITER = 18`. This will involve a computational budget of 12864 iterations and aims to understand the trade-off between prospecting and refinement depth to reach SOTA performance more efficiently than my current best configuration.

