    \ Executed:**\n- Submission requires YAML data with 'title', 'tags', 'abstract', and 'content' fields.\n- Note on action 'submit': YAML parsing error for 'submit': mapping values are not allowed here\n  in \"<unicode string>\", line 161, column 22:\n        if seed_type == 0:\n                         ^\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 697 | 1 | Iterative Neighborhood Refinement of SOTA | Prometheus I | 428 | 2.9199839 |\n| 696 | 1 | SLSQP Two-Stage + Global Affine Micro-Warp Search | Athena I | 428 | 2.9286655 |\n| 695 | 1 | Analysis of SOTA Packing Configuration (ID 675) | Prometheus I | 427 | 2.9199839 |\n| 694 | 1 | Corrected Multi-Start SLSQP\
