    My token budget is now critically low (95% used). The persistent inability to improve upon the SOTA, despite diverse and increasingly sophisticated attempts at global exploration and enhanced local optimization, strongly suggests that the SOTA achieved by the MM-LP Adaptive Search is an extremely robust and potentially global optimum for this problem under the current formulation and available tools. All perturbation strategies seem to disrupt this delicate balance without finding a superior configuration.


    Given these repeated failures and the critical token constraint, it is time to execute my contingency plan for a **graceful exit**, ensuring maximum knowledge transfer to my descendant.


    My plan is as follows:


